{"id":"f38d3af41ad79a49","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/455_有限_Gödel–Dummett_逻辑_LC_n.md","title":"有限 Gödel–Dummett 逻辑 LC n","display":"有限 Gödel–Dummett 逻辑 LC_n","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"1.-原始符号与参数\">1. 原始符号与参数</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。固定参数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge 2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge 2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\quad \\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{and},\\quad \\operatorname{or}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var},\\quad \\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{and},\\quad \\operatorname{or}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,A\\to B,A\\land B,A\\lor B\">\\(p,\\bot,A\\to B,A\\land B,A\\lor B\\)</span> 不是额外构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-公式闭包\">2. 公式闭包</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"3.-有限析取缩写\">3. 有限析取缩写</h2>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bor}:\n\\bigcup_{0&lt;k&lt;\\omega}\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^{k}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bor}:\n\\bigcup_{0&lt;k&lt;\\omega}\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^{k}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&gt;0\">\\(k&gt;0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:k\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\sigma:k\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>，其值由下列递归确定：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma)=\\sigma(0)\n\\quad\\text{当 }k=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma)=\\sigma(0)\n\\quad\\text{当 }k=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma{\\upharpoonright}m)\\lor\\sigma(m)\n\\quad\\text{当 }k=m+1,\\ m\\ge 1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma{\\upharpoonright}m)\\lor\\sigma(m)\n\\quad\\text{当 }k=m+1,\\ m\\ge 1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bor}\">\\(\\operatorname{Bor}\\)</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}\\)</span> 构造出的派生缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4.-自由变量、替换与等同\">4. 自由变量、替换与等同</h2>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A\\land B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A\\land B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A\\lor B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A\\lor B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(q)[p:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(q)[p:=B]=\n\\begin{cases}\nB,&amp;q=p,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(q),&amp;q\\ne p,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}[p:=B]=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot}[p:=B]=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\to C[p:=B],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\to C[p:=B],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\land C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\land C[p:=B],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\land C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\land C[p:=B],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\lor C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\lor C[p:=B].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\lor C)[p:=B]=A[p:=B]\\lor C[p:=B].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为常值空集。无绑定构造子，故新鲜名选择、绑定变量重命名和捕获避免条件均不作为对象语言操作。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为字面等同，即</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{LC}_n}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{LC}_n}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.-直觉主义基础公理\">5. 直觉主义基础公理</h2>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{IPC}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\bigcup_{1\\le i\\le 9}\\mathsf{LCnI}_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{IPC}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\bigcup_{1\\le i\\le 9}\\mathsf{LCnI}_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>九个本地公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_1=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_1=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_2=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_2=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_3=\\{A\\land B\\to A:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_3=\\{A\\land B\\to A:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_4=\\{A\\land B\\to B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_4=\\{A\\land B\\to B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_5=\\{A\\to(B\\to A\\land B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_5=\\{A\\to(B\\to A\\land B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_6=\\{A\\to A\\lor B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_6=\\{A\\to A\\lor B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_7=\\{B\\to A\\lor B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_7=\\{B\\to A\\lor B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_8=\\{(A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_8=\\{(A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LCnI}_9=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LCnI}_9=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"6.-有限-Gödel–Dummett-公理\">6. 有限 Gödel–Dummett 公理</h2>\n<p>先定义 LC 的线性公理族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Lin}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\{(A\\to B)\\lor(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Lin}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\{(A\\to B)\\lor(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义相邻蕴含列算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf d_n:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^{n+1}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf d_n:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^{n+1}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:(n+1)\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\alpha:(n+1)\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_\\alpha=\\mathsf d_n(\\alpha)\">\\(d_\\alpha=\\mathsf d_n(\\alpha)\\)</span>，并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_\\alpha(i)=\\alpha(i)\\to\\alpha(i+1)\n\\qquad(i\\in n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_\\alpha(i)=\\alpha(i)\\to\\alpha(i+1)\n\\qquad(i\\in n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限值特征公理族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n\\mathsf{fin}}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{Bor}(d_\\alpha):\\alpha:(n+1)\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n\\mathsf{fin}}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{Bor}(d_\\alpha):\\alpha:(n+1)\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{IPC}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Lin}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n\\mathsf{fin}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{IPC}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Lin}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n\\mathsf{fin}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标特征是保留 LC 的二元线性公理，并加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 个公式之间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个相邻蕴含的有限析取；该新增公理族把系统限制为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 值 Gödel 逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7.-推理规则\">7. 推理规则</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^2\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^2\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"8.-证明对象与可证性\">8. 证明对象与可证性</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>组成的集合，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，并且每行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>行合法性谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA_i\\in\\Gamma\n\\lor A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\lor \\exists j,k&lt;i\\,((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA_i\\in\\Gamma\n\\lor A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n\\lor \\exists j,k&lt;i\\,((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>携带有限证明证书的主判断为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MainJud}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MainJud}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,A,\\pi)\\in\\mathsf{MainJud}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\">\\((\\Gamma,A,\\pi)\\in\\mathsf{MainJud}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是上述非空有限公式列、末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\">\\(\\mathsf{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LC}_n\n=\n(n,\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\operatorname{Bor},\n\\mathsf d_n,\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Lin}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n\\mathsf{fin}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{MainJud}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LC}_n\n=\n(n,\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\operatorname{Bor},\n\\mathsf d_n,\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Lin}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n\\mathsf{fin}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MP}}^{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{LineOK}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{MainJud}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{LC}_n},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含有限 Gödel–Dummett 逻辑的句法、公理、派生有限析取、MP 与证明关系；不含有限链语义、真值表或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与参数","text":"1. 原始符号与参数","level":2},{"id":"2.-公式闭包","text":"2. 公式闭包","level":2},{"id":"3.-有限析取缩写","text":"3. 有限析取缩写","level":2},{"id":"4.-自由变量、替换与等同","text":"4. 自由变量、替换与等同","level":2},{"id":"5.-直觉主义基础公理","text":"5. 直觉主义基础公理","level":2},{"id":"6.-有限-Gödel–Dummett-公理","text":"6. 有限 Gödel–Dummett 公理","level":2},{"id":"7.-推理规则","text":"7. 推理规则","level":2},{"id":"8.-证明对象与可证性","text":"8. 证明对象与可证性","level":2},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N,\\qquad n\\ge 2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var},\\quad \\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{and},\\quad \\operatorname{or}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,A\\to B,A\\land B,A\\lor B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bor}:\n\\bigcup_{0<k<\\omega}\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}^{k}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}.","display":true},{"tex":"k>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:k\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma)=\\sigma(0)\n\\quad\\text{当 }k=1,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Bor}(\\sigma{\\upharpoonright}m)\\lor\\sigma(m)\n\\quad\\text{当 }k=m+1,\\ m\\ge 1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{or}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\operatorname{var}(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A\\land B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{LC}_n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname